AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400182 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400182 "Food product having functional characteristics similar to milk; it may be nutritionally equivalent or inferior to the product it purports to resemble."@en)
