AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400243 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400243 "A soup in which the liquid phase has low viscosity."@en)
