# Class: obo:FOODON_03400264 (vegetable juice (us cfr))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400264 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400264 "The liquid extracted or expressed from mature vegetables with or without optional ingredients such as seasoning or salt.  Products prepared from vegetable juice by thickening with gelatin or pectin are indexed under the broader term *VEGETABLE OR VEGETABLE PRODUCT*. For part or portion, index the part or the plant from which the juice was extracted, rather than *PLANT EXTRACT, CONCENTRATE, OR ISOLATE*."@en)
