AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400266 "Pasteurized cheese product made without emulsifier and with opional dairy ingredients. Milkfat minimum 20% of total; moisture minimum 44%, maximum 60% (21 CFR 133.175, 133.176)."@en)
