AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400274 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400274 "Formulated and often nutritionally controlled product marketed for consumption in place of a conventional meal. The product may be used as the sole or major source of nourishment. It is frequently offered in a form convenient to use. Includes infant formula, products designed for weight loss, instant breakfast, interal and parenteral complete nutrition solutions, etc."@en)
