AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400276 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400276 "Standardized or nonstandardized mixture of edible fats or oils, acidifying agents and optional ingredients such as sweeteners (nutritive or nonnutritive), starch, egg and seasonings. Used in limited amounts to accompany salads and other foods."@en)
