AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400331 "Substance used to dissolve, dilute, disperse or otherwise physically modify a food additive without altering its technological function (and without exerting any technological effect themselves) in order to facilitate its handling, application or use."@en)
