AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400793 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400793 "This category includes: carcass meat of mammals and birds; offal of mammals and birds; a food product whose predominant constituent is meat; a recipe dish whose main ingredient is considered to be meat."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03400793 langual:A0793)
