AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400794 "The group includes carcass meat of domestic animals (e.g. beef, veal, pork, mutton / lamb, horse, rabbit) and game (e.g. wild pig, boar, venison, whale)."@en)
