AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400796 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400796 "An organ meat product such as liver, kidney, tongue, heart, trotters, giblets."@en)
