# Class: obo:FOODON_03400798 (sausage or similar meat product (eurofir))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400798 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400798 "Includes: pastes, pâtés and terrines; sausage meat; dry, smoked sausages (rohwurst); fresh and lightly cooked sausages (bratwurst); cooked sausages (kochwurst); blood & blood products (e.g. haggis, black pudding); other meat products (e.g. galantine, brawn)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03400798 langual:A0798)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03400798 "sausage or similar meat product (eurofir)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03400798 obo:FOODON_03400793)

