# Class: obo:FOODON_03400801 (seafood or related product (eurofir))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400801 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400801 "The group includes marine or freshwater fish, molluscs, crustaceans, and other fauna such as reptiles, insects or frogs not in the Meats group. The group also includes seafood product analogs and seafood-based sausage or luncheon meat as well as such products as squid ink and clam juice."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03400801 langual:A0801)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03400801 "seafood or related product (eurofir)"@en)
