# Class: obo:FOODON_03400805 (fat or oil (eurofir))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400805 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400805 "Food substance or component consisting predominantly of mixed glycerol esters of fatty acids and, in far lesser amounts, of fatty acids, sterols and pigments. A fat is solid at room temperature; an oil is liquid at room temperature (20 degrees C). Excludes essential oils."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03400805 langual:A0805)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03400805 "LanguaL curation note: Index also *FAT OR OIL* or subgroups in facet C."@en)
