AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03400806 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03400806 "In this context, vegetable fats are oils that are solid at room temperature (e.g. palm oil, cocoa butter). It may also apply to hydrogenated (hardened) vegetable fats."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03400806 langual:A0806)
