AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540003 "The group includes any type of Cereal grain and cereal-like grain. The part consumed/analysed is not specified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors. In case of data collections related to legislations, the default part consumed/analysed is the one defined in the applicable legislation.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grain] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Cereal+grains+cereal+like+grains]"@en)
