AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540004 "The group includes any type of Mixture of grains, i.e. a mixture containing a considerable proportion of grains from different cereals. The part consumed/analysed is by default unspecified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grain] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Mixture+of+grains]"@en)
