# Class: obo:FOODON_03540129 (01290 - pumpernickel (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03540129 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540129 "The group includes any type of Pumpernickel. Pumpernickel is a type of very heavy, slightly sweet rye bread traditionally made with coarsely ground rye. It is now often made with a combination of rye flour and whole rye grains. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumpernickel] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Pumpernickel]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03540129 langual:A005J)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03540129 "01290 - pumpernickel (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03540129 obo:FOODON_03540126)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03540130 (01300 - bread and rolls with special ingredients added (efsa foodex2))

