AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540130 "The group includes any type of Bread and rolls with special ingredients added. All the characterising ingredients should be reported with additional facet descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bread] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Bread+rolls+with+special+ingredients+added]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03540130 langual:A005K)
