AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540207 "The group includes any type of Ingredient rich fine dough without yeast, i.e. doughs made by using chemical leavening agents, richer in eggs, sugar and fat than other doughs. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/dough]"@en)
