AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540233 "The group includes any type of dry pre-mixes containing flour, dried yeast and other ingredients used for the preparation of bread (usually home-made bread), after addition of a proper liquid. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baking_mix] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Bread+premixes+]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03540233 langual:A0CSL)
