# Class: obo:FOODON_03540283 (02830 - brioche type products (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03540283 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540283 "The group includes any type of Brioche and similar products (with or without topping-filling). The brioche is usually a yeast-leavened enriched dough based pastry, such as Panettone, Pandoro, Kalacs, Cozonac and Kalac. Information on inclusions/fillings/toppings should be reported with additional facets descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brioche] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Brioche+type+products]"@en)
