AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540285 "The group includes any type of sweet pastry made out of dough that has been shaped and fried, such as Chiacchiere, Angel wings and Bugnes. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity. ] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angel_wings] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Fried+dough+sweet]"@en)
