AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540291 "The group includes any type of pastry based on a baked laminated dough such as Puff pastry and Danish pastry. The layering process and the fat present between the layers provides a structure made of multiple thin sheets. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danish_pastry] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Pastry+based+on+laminated+dough]"@en)
