# Class: obo:FOODON_03540307 (03070 - puddings based on cereal products and/or nuts/fruits and similar (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03540307 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540307 "The group includes any type of pudding or dessert based on cereal products or bread (including both sweet and savoury variants) or nuts or fruits or similar. Christmas pudding, Plum pudding and Bread pudding are included in this group. All the characterising ingredients should be reported with additional facet descriptors. Starchy puddings are not included in this term and should be coded as A02PY 'Starchy pudding'. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puddings] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=christmas pudding and bread pudding]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03540307 langual:A16EQ)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03540307 "bread pudding"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03540307 "christmas pudding"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03540307 "plum pudding"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03540307 "03070 - puddings based on cereal products and/or nuts/fruits and similar (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03540307 obo:FOODON_03540297)

