AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540343 "The group includes any type of Processed oat-based flakes. Cereal flakes are breakfast cereals usually obtained by soaking-cooking/steaming, pressing, drying and flaking cereal grains/flours mixed with admixture of additional ingredients (e.g. sweeteners). The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=oat+flakes]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03540343 langual:A00DN)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03540343 "03430 - processed oat-based flakes (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03540343 obo:FOODON_03540339)

