AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03540781 "The group includes any type of Fungi, mosses and lichens as defined in the pesticide regulation. The part consumed/analysed is not specified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors. In case of data collections related to legislations, the default part consumed/analysed is the one defined in the applicable legislation."@en)
