AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03541961 "The group includes any type of Marine mammals meat (ISSCAAP division 6). The meat of various species is used as food or feed in some areas of the world. The blubber (i.e. whale or seal fat) fat and train oil (oil derived from whale fat) is used after processing as raw material in food or feed manufacture.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meat]"@en)
