# Class: obo:FOODON_03542107 (21070 - processed whole meat products (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03542107 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03542107 "The group includes any type of processed whole meat products, i.e. cured meat cuts made of entire pieces of muscle meat. They can include relevant portions of fat tissues. The part consumed/analysed is by default either the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity. The eventual removal of not edible parts is unspecified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Processed_meat] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=cured and seasoned meat made of entire pieces of muscle]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03542107 langual:A04ND)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03542107 "21070 - processed whole meat products (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03542107 obo:FOODON_03541876)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03542108 (21080 - raw cured (or seasoned) meat (efsa foodex2))

