# Class: obo:FOODON_03542153 (21530 - mettwurst-type sausage (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03542153 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03542153 "The group includes any type of Mettwurst-type sausage (Mettwurst), based on cured beef and/or pork, ground and lightly spiced with allspice, ginger, mustard and coriander. Mettwurst is usually smoked and has smooth and spreadable consistency. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity. The eventual removal of not edible parts is unspecified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mettwurst] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Mettwurst sausage]"@en)
