AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03542183 "The group includes any type of Weisswurst, a white sausage of Bavarian (German) origin made of pork and veal. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity. The eventual removal of not edible parts is unspecified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weisswurst] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Weisswurst]"@en)
