AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03542211 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03542211 "The category covers all fresh and preserved products obtained from fish, other seafood, and all remaining non-mammals and non-bird terrestrial animals. Marine mammals are included as well."@en)
