AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03542212 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03542212 "The group includes fish meat, i.e. the fleshy parts of fishes. Fish are gilled, aquatic vertebrate and/or cartilaginous animals of various zoological families and species, usually wild, as caught and prepared for wholesale and retail distribution. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity. ] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fish_as_food] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Fish (meat)]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03542212 langual:A026V)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03542212 "22120 - fish (meat) (efsa foodex2)"@en)
