AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03542484 "The group includes any type of crustacean belonging to the ISSCAAP group 41: Freshwater crustaceans. Freshwater crustaceans of the taxonomic groups Astacus spp., Procambarus spp., Macrobrachium spp., family Palaemonidae, are included in this group.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Freshwater_crustaceans] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Freshwater crustaceans]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03542484 langual:A02FE)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03542484 "astacus spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03542484 "macrobrachium spp."@en)
