AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543044 "The group includes Spreadable chocolate products based on cacao ingredients, different types of fats and very often nut derivatives. For example chocolate-hazelnut spread like nutella and other similar brands are included in this group. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate_spread] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Chocolate spread]"@en)
