AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543279 "The group includes any type of soft drink with minor amounts of fruits or flavours, i.e. drinks with flavours, sweetening ingredients and, in the case of fruit tasting sorts, with relatively small amounts of fruit. These drinks are mostly carbonated. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soft_drink] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Soft drinks with minor amounts of fruits or flavours]"@en)
