# Class: obo:FOODON_03543348 (33480 - wine and wine-like drinks (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543348 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543348 "The category covers any type of Wine and wine-like drinks, i.e. alcoholic beverages made by fermenting grape juice (or other fruits). Wine may be sparkling or carbonated, made from condensed grape must, made from agricultural products other than the juice of grapes. Products sold as wine such as imitation wine, cider and perry are included in this group. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wine] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Wine and similar]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543348 langual:A03MS)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543348 "33480 - wine and wine-like drinks (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543348 obo:FOODON_03543330)

