# Class: obo:FOODON_03543362 (33620 - raisin wine (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543362 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543362 "The group includes any type of Raisin wine (such as passito wine), also named straw wine since the classic method dries clusters of grapes on mats of straw in the sun; in some regions clusters of grapes are dried under cover, or are hung up, or the straw is replaced by modern racks. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raisin_wine] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Raisin wine]"@en)
