AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543437 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543437 "The group includes any type of mix intended to be diluted with hot liquids, like milk or water, to prepare a hot drink. They usually contain many ingredients like milk components, sugar and flavourings. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion."@en)
