AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543711 "The group includes any type of Iced coffee, a cold coffee possibly with ice (e.g. shakerato coffee). The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iced_coffee]"@en)
