# Class: obo:FOODON_03543797 (37970 - carbohydrate-rich energy food products for sports people (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543797 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543797 "The group includes Carbohydrate-rich energy food products for sports people. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Carbohydrate-rich energy food for sport on the market]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543797 langual:A03RY)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543797 "37970 - carbohydrate-rich energy food products for sports people (efsa foodex2)"@en)
