# Class: obo:FOODON_03543798 (37980 - carbohydrate-electrolyte solutions for sports people (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543798 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543798 "The group includes Carbohydrate-electrolyte solutions for sports people such as drinks containing added carbohydrates and electrolytes. Commercially formulated sports drinks are intended to serve a variety of purposes, including supply of substrate, prevention of dehydration and promotion of post-exercise recovery. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Carbohydrate-electrolyte sport drink on the market]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543798 langual:A03RZ)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543798 "37980 - carbohydrate-electrolyte solutions for sports people (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543798 obo:FOODON_03543796)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543799 (37990 - protein and protein components for sports people (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543799 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543799 "The group includes Protein and protein components for sports people, usually consumed by endurance and strength training athletes. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Protein products for sports people on the market]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543799 langual:A03SA)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543799 "37990 - protein and protein components for sports people (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543799 obo:FOODON_03543796)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543800 (38000 - micronutrients supplement for sports people (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543800 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543800 "The group includes Micronutrients (such as minerals, trace elements and vitamins) supplement for sports people. In the case of restricted food intake, as is frequently observed in weight related sports, micronutrient intake could become marginal or deficient, which would justify supplementation. Intake of a number of minerals and vitamins such as magnesium, calcium, zinc and the anti-oxidants vitamins C, E as well as carotenoids, have been suggested to be critical in relation to physical performance. The products in this group are intended to address these real or purported needs. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=micronutrient supplement for sports people on the market]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543800 langual:A03SB)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543800 "38000 - micronutrients supplement for sports people (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543800 obo:FOODON_03543796)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543801 (38010 - carnitine or creatine-based supplement for sports people (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543801 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543801 "The group includes specific supplements for sports people based on carnitine or creatine intended to improve performance during high intensity exercise. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Carnitine or creatine-based supplement for sports people]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543801 langual:A03SC)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543801 "38010 - carnitine or creatine-based supplement for sports people (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543801 obo:FOODON_03543796)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543802 (38020 - dietary foods for special medical purposes (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543802 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543802 "The group includes any type of Dietary foods for special medical purposes as defined by EU legislation. These foods are intended for the exclusive or partial feeding of people whose nutritional requirements cannot be met by normal foods. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medical_food] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Dietary foods for special medical purposes]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543802 langual:A03SD)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543802 "38020 - dietary foods for special medical purposes (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543802 obo:FOODON_03543792)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543803 (38030 - nutritionally complete formulae (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543803 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543803 "The group includes any type of Nutritionally complete formulae, which supply all the required nutrients in sufficient quantities. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medical_food] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Nutritionally complete formula food for special medical purposes]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543803 langual:A03SE)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543803 "38030 - nutritionally complete formulae (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543803 obo:FOODON_03543802)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543804 (38040 - nutritionally incomplete formulae (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543804 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543804 "The group includes any type of Nutritionally incomplete formulae, which supply a single or a combination of nutrients in quantities insufficient. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medical_food] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Nutritionally incomplete formulae for special medical purposes]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543804 langual:A03SF)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543804 "38040 - nutritionally incomplete formulae (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543804 obo:FOODON_03543802)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543805 (38050 - formulas for metabolic disorders (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543805 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543805 "The group includes any type of Formulas for metabolic disorders (usually genetic disorders). The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medical_food] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Formula for metabolic disorder food for special medical purposes]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543805 langual:A03SG)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543805 "38050 - formulas for metabolic disorders (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543805 obo:FOODON_03543802)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543806 (38060 - oral rehydration products (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543806 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543806 "The group includes any type of oral rehydration products, for replacement of water and electrolytes. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medical_food] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Oral rehydration products]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543806 langual:A03SH)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543806 "38060 - oral rehydration products (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543806 obo:FOODON_03543802)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543807 (38070 - food supplements and similar preparations (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543807 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543807 "The group includes any type of Food supplements intended for general population or specific age groups and also other preparations that, while not necessarily providing nutrients to integrate the diet, are a source of nutraceutical substances. These preparations are commonly either in capsules / tablets or in powder or in liquid form. Supplements for sporting people are included in a specific separate group because they have tentative classes in view of possible regulations. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Food supplement]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543807 langual:A03SJ)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543807 "38070 - food supplements and similar preparations (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543807 obo:FOODON_03543791)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543808 (38080 - mixed supplements/formulations (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543808 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543808 "The group includes any type of supplements combining different principles without a strong dominance of one. If relevant, all the characterising ingredients should be reported with additional facet descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=multi supplement]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543808 langual:A03TC)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543808 "38080 - mixed supplements/formulations (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543808 obo:FOODON_03543807)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543809 (38090 - vitamin and mineral supplements (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543809 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543809 "The group includes any type of supplements based on vitamins and minerals, excluding those claimed for sporting people and the carbohydrate-electrolyte solutions, addressed by a specific group. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Vitamin and mineral supplements]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543809 langual:A03SK)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543809 "38090 - vitamin and mineral supplements (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543809 obo:FOODON_03543807)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543810 (38100 - vitamin only supplements (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543810 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543810 "The group includes all supplements based only on vitamins. If relevant, all the characterising ingredients should be reported with additional facet descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Vitamin only supplements]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543810 langual:A03SL)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543810 "38100 - vitamin only supplements (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543810 obo:FOODON_03543809)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543811 (38110 - mineral only supplements (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543811 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543811 "The group includes all supplements based only on minerals (normally salts of different chemical elements). If relevant, all the characterising ingredients should be reported with additional facet descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Mineral only supplements]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543811 langual:A03SM)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543811 "38110 - mineral only supplements (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543811 obo:FOODON_03543809)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543812 (38120 - combination of vitamin and mineral only supplements (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543812 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543812 "The group includes all supplements based only on formulations including both minerals (normally salts of different chemical elements) and vitamins. If relevant, all the characterising ingredients should be reported with additional facet descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=multi vitamin and mineral supplements]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543812 langual:A03SN)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543812 "38120 - combination of vitamin and mineral only supplements (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543812 obo:FOODON_03543809)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543813 (38130 - miscellaneous supplements or nutraceuticals (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543813 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543813 "The group includes substances other than vitamins and minerals used as dietary supplement or as nutraceutical (functional preparations). In case of preparations based principally on one of the groups of principles listed below, but with the addition of some minerals or vitamins (minor presence), they have to be reported with the specific group as base term and minor amount of vitamins/minerals as ingredient facet.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Miscellaneous supplements or nutraceuticals]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543813 langual:A03SP)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543813 "38130 - miscellaneous supplements or nutraceuticals (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543813 obo:FOODON_03543807)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03543814 (38140 - bee-produced formulations (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543814 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543814 "The group includes any type of supplements/nutraceuticals originating from apiculture. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Bee-produced product]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543814 langual:A03SQ)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543814 "38140 - bee-produced formulations (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543814 obo:FOODON_03543813)

