AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543815 "The group includes any type of Fiber supplements. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fibre_supplements] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Fiber supplements]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543815 langual:A03SR)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543815 "38150 - fiber supplements (efsa foodex2)"@en)
