# Class: obo:FOODON_03543816 (38160 - herbal formulations and plant extracts (efsa foodex2))

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543816 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543816 "The group includes any type of supplement based on Herbal formulations and/or plant extracts (with exclusion of algae, having a specific group). The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_supplement] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Herbal formulations and plant extracts supplement]"@en)
