AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543932 "The group includes any type of Pizza and pizza-like dishes. Pizza like dishes include pies and other topped/filled cereal dough bases (normally from doughs other than bread dough) cooked after topping/filling. Taking into account the broad variability of toppings/fillings, more detailed information on the characterising ingredients can be added with additional facet descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_pizza_varieties_by_country] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Pizza and similar dishes]"@en)
