AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03543944 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03543944 "The group includes any type of Pie and tart-type pastry (either small, used as finger food, or larger) with savoury (vegetable and-or meat and-or cheese) filling. For example Erbazzone, Vegetable pie and Meat pie are included in this group. Taking into account the broad variability of savoury pies and tarts, more detailed information on the characterising ingredients can be added with additional facet descriptors. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_pies,_tarts_and_flans] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Savoury pies and tarts]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03543944 langual:A0CEN)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03543944 "erbazzone"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03543944 "meat pie"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03543944 "vegetable pie"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03543944 "39440 - savoury pies and tarts (efsa foodex2)"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03543944 obo:FOODON_03543918)

