AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544181 "Mixture of chemicals and/or extracts formulated in such a way to reproduce the original Mint-chocolate flavour. The effect is generally intense, therefore small amounts are able to provide a well recognisable smell and taste to the food to which it is added.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flavor] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Mint-chocolate food flavouring]"@en)
