AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03544426 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544426 "The group includes any type of Modified starch, i.e. substances obtained by one or more chemical treatments of edible starches, which may have undergone a physical or enzymatic treatment, and may be acid or alkali thinned or bleached. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modified_starch] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=Modified starch]"@en)
