AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03544483 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544483 "The group includes Vitamin C used for fortification or enrichment of foods. Vitamin C or L-ascorbic acid, or simply ascorbate (the anion of ascorbic acid), is an essential nutrient for humans and certain other animal species] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitamin_C_]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03544483 langual:A0EXN)
