AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544484 "The group includes Vitamin D used for fortification or enrichment of foods. Vitamin D refers to a group of fat-soluble secosteroids responsible for enhancing intestinal absorption of calcium, iron, magnesium, phosphate and zinc] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitamin_D_]"@en)
