AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544505 "Fortifying agents containing considerable amounts of dietary fiber. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity. ] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietary_fibre]"@en)
