AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544506 "The group includes Phytochemicals used as fortifying agents. They are produced from herbs or extracted from vegetables. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion. ] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phytochemicals]"@en)
