AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544513 "Glucosamine (C6H13NO5) is an amino sugar and a precursor in the biochemical synthesis of glycosylated proteins and lipids. Glucosamine is commonly used as a food supplement to support the structure and function of joints.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glucosamine]"@en)
