AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03544515 "The group includes Pollen (residues of vegetal pollens) as defined in EU pesticide regulation. The part consumed/analysed is not specified. When relevant, information on the part consumed/analysed has to be reported with additional facet descriptors. In case of data collections related to legislations, the default part consumed/analysed is the one defined in the applicable legislation.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bee_pollen] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm=isch&q=edible bee pollen]"@en)
